|description2 = {{sbc|Blight:}} For each stack consumed, the target is dealt {{as|'''bonus''' magic damage}}. If the stacks were consumed with ''{{ai|Piercing Arrow|Varus}}'', this damage is increased by {{#var:q_mod}}. This damage is capped at {{ap|360/3}} per stack against {{tip|monsters}}, for a total cap of 360 at maximum stacks.<br><br>Additionally, each stack consumed against a {{tip|champion}} or epic {{tip|monster}} reduces the {{sti|'''remaining''' cooldowns}} of '''Varus' ''' basic abilities by {{#var:cdr}}% of each of their '''total''' cooldowns, up to a {{ap|{{#var:cdr}}*3}}% cooldown reduction per target. If the stacks were consumed with ''{{ai|Piercing Arrow|Varus}}'', the cooldown reduction is increased by {{#var:q_mod}}, up to a {{pp|{{#var:cdr}}*3 to {{#var:cdr}}*3*1.5|0 to 1.25 by 0.125|key=%|type=[[File:Varus Piercing Arrow.png|20px|border]] Piercing Arrow's charge time|formula=39% + 1.95% per 0.125 seconds. ''This is capped at 1.25 seconds.''|round1=3|showtype=false}} cooldown reduction per target from consuming maximum stacks against them.
